# promise: #50 #88
# The toolbar as shipped for #50 and #88, drawn from the running window: the bar starts with the
# sidebar toggle, 21 pt from the card edge, then ← → ↻, with the sidebar shown or hidden (#50 had
# it in the sidebar's header while the sidebar shows; the product owner moved it to the bar,
# Nov 2026); the address shows the host only, with Arc's Copy URL glyph as a button of its own (#88).
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": true}
niche://debug?windowSize=1280x800
niche://open?url=${PAGE}?n=toolbar
wait 3
snapshot PaneToolbarView toolbar-host-only
niche://action/toggleSidebar
wait 2
snapshot PaneToolbarView toolbar-sidebar-hidden
niche://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
